  "details": "A basic feature we need is some way to do hit-scan. The raycast node should return the position of the intersection of the ray as well as the object it hit. Another thing that would be very helpful is a filter for the raycast, so it does not hit objects set to a certain tag or layer and does not immediately hit the object it is being casted from.",
